==Restriction==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Heartbeat Catcademy (Event Gacha)|Heartbeat Catcademy]] Units

==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Confessional Tree (Enemy Base)|Confessional Tree]].
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33~43.33 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,300f</sup>.
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~33.33 seconds<sup>400f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
Spam any of the [[Heartbeat Catcademy (Event Gacha)|Heartbeat Catcademy]] Units to win.

